WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.701
(intense music)

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.500
(garage door opening)

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.410
- [Narrator] Today, the attempt will be

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.350
to set the fastest speed

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.530
ever accomplished in an
aircraft that originally

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.053
was made in World War II.

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:17.670
(zipping)

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.930
- [Steve] It's a good
question, "Why would you

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.450
wanna do something like this?"

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.660
And, honestly, there's
no good explanation.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.180
There's no money involved doing it.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.040
I'm sure none of you have
ever heard about this record.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.978
This is 1940's technology.

00:00:28.978 --> 00:00:31.273
The engine is commonly breaking.

00:00:31.273 --> 00:00:32.130
(engine roaring)

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.000
Today, we're squeezing
every last bit of it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.960
You're traveling at 800 feet per second,

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.480
which is faster than a 45 caliber bullet

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.321
out of the muzzle.

00:00:41.321 --> 00:00:42.290
(plane zooming by)

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.730
You have an engine that is screaming loud

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.570
in front of you.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.920
The cockpit's 140 degrees inside.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.028
There's no computers.

00:00:49.028 --> 00:00:50.492
No digital touch screens.

00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:51.640
(static)

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.437
You talk to the engine,
console it, caress it.

00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:55.520
- Alright, last chance.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:56.353
Come on, baby.

00:00:56.353 --> 00:00:57.390
- Come on, hold together.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.230
You can hold together.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:01.147
(plane zooming by)

00:01:03.364 --> 00:01:05.614
To break this record,
you have to be perfect.

